    "implementation_guidance": "This enhanced implementation guidance for Brief Cognitive-Behavioral Therapy for Anxiety (BCBT-A) integrates key components of the Consolidated Framework for Implementation Research (CFIR) to facilitate successful adoption, implementation, and sustainment within clinical settings, particularly for social workers in clinical/therapy roles. 1. Assess organizational readiness by evaluating the innovation's fit with existing workflows and culture (Tension for Change, Compatibility). 2. Evaluate existing infrastructure, including physical space, IT support, and staffing levels (Structural Characteristics). 3. Identify key stakeholders, including leadership, opinion leaders, and implementation champions, to garner support and facilitate the implementation process (Individuals Domain).",
